(6231702, 921239, 117534, '<td valign="top">Had to come back and up my vote on this... it''s really strange, I really like it, but those are the strangest clouds I''ve ever seen</td>', 'Had to come back and up my vote on this... it''s really strange, I really like it, but those are the strangest clouds I''ve ever seen', '2010-11-24 01:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231705, 921198, 117534, '<td valign="top">Just told one guy I gave my only 10 to his photo, but I lied here is another.. I''d hang this in my house any day!!!</td>', 'Just told one guy I gave my only 10 to his photo, but I lied here is another.. I''d hang this in my house any day!!!', '2010-11-24 01:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231709, 921232, 116649, '<td valign="top">Having spent Spring break of 1991, a year where there had been absolutely no rain and following a seven-year drought, during the week dubbed as <a href="//www.tahoedailytribune.com/article/20080313/NEWS/338028790" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"The March Miracle"</a> in Yosemite, I appreciate how difficult it is to get good shots during inclement weather!   I hope your patience was paid off in tripple while you waited for the storm to break, and that you are appropriately rewarded for your efforts!</td>', 'Having spent Spring break of 1991, a year where there had been absolutely no rain and following a seven-year drought, during the week dubbed as "The March Miracle" in Yosemite, I appreciate how difficult it is to get good shots during inclement weather!   I hope your patience was paid off in tripple while you waited for the storm to break, and that you are appropriately rewarded for your efforts!', '2010-11-24 01:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231710, 921347, 117534, '<td valign="top">Really freaking Awesome...</td>', 'Really freaking Awesome...', '2010-11-24 01:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
