(6231718, 921419, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo that sacrafices the normal subject to emphasise the clouds.  Well done. 7.<br/> <br/>A few hours ago the second blast occured at the mine and assuming you''re a New Zealander, my heart goes out to your country.  The loss of the 29 miners is a tragedy that is felt here in Australia as I''m sure around the world.</td>', 'Lovely photo that sacrafices the normal subject to emphasise the clouds.  Well done. 7. A few hours ago the second blast occured at the mine and assuming you''re a New Zealander, my heart goes out to your country.  The loss of the 29 miners is a tragedy that is felt here in Australia as I''m sure around the world.', '2010-11-24 01:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
