(6231818, 921368, 110041, '<td valign="top">I had several shots similar to this. I like the moody feel but the difficulty is the blown out moon. Perhaps if you had a shot with some cloud masking it it would be slightly less distracting.</td>', 'I had several shots similar to this. I like the moody feel but the difficulty is the blown out moon. Perhaps if you had a shot with some cloud masking it it would be slightly less distracting.', '2010-11-24 03:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
