(6232101, 921595, 33736, '<td valign="top">If these kinds of reds weren''t familiar to me, I''d almost think it was over-saturated. The middle section looks like a land-mass, and the wispy clouds over the heavier area are wonderful.  This will probably score high.  Good Luck.</td>', 'If these kinds of reds weren''t familiar to me, I''d almost think it was over-saturated. The middle section looks like a land-mass, and the wispy clouds over the heavier area are wonderful.  This will probably score high.  Good Luck.', '2010-11-24 10:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
