(6232112, 921518, 33736, '<td valign="top">The clouds are not exposed well (too many blown out areas and little contrast and definition.)  You have made the rock formation the main subject, which misses the Challenge (and that light-flare is not a good thing.)</td>', 'The clouds are not exposed well (too many blown out areas and little contrast and definition.)  You have made the rock formation the main subject, which misses the Challenge (and that light-flare is not a good thing.)', '2010-11-24 10:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
