(6232123, 920853, 33736, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines on the right-upward diagonal.  I maybe would have clipped a bit off the left side and bottom (that bit of water to the left of the small island is distracting.) That didn''t affect my scoring, btw. 7, at least.</td>', 'Nice leading lines on the right-upward diagonal.  I maybe would have clipped a bit off the left side and bottom (that bit of water to the left of the small island is distracting.) That didn''t affect my scoring, btw. 7, at least.', '2010-11-24 10:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
