(6232139, 921666, 33736, '<td valign="top">The picture may be a little too saturated, so the white cloud and blue water areas look too harsh to be a reflection.</td>', 'The picture may be a little too saturated, so the white cloud and blue water areas look too harsh to be a reflection.', '2010-11-24 10:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232142, 921571, 33736, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to discover the meaning of your title.  Lovely pano,  and although the clouds are a small portion of the entire image, they draw my eyes over and over.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Can''t wait to discover the meaning of your title.  Lovely pano,  and although the clouds are a small portion of the entire image, they draw my eyes over and over.  Nicely done.', '2010-11-24 10:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
