(6232192, 921547, 33736, '<td valign="top">The tilt on the Lighthouse is so distracting, and the reflection doesn''t look natural.  Had you straightened the horizon, saturated less, and cropped a lot off the top (would have made the clouds more prominent) and right side, This would have been a really special scene in my opinion.</td>', 'The tilt on the Lighthouse is so distracting, and the reflection doesn''t look natural.  Had you straightened the horizon, saturated less, and cropped a lot off the top (would have made the clouds more prominent) and right side, This would have been a really special scene in my opinion.', '2010-11-24 11:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232195, 921302, 33736, '<td valign="top">"Just because you can, doesn''t mean you should!"  The colors seem to result from Topaz "Venice" or something similar.  I have a feeling this would have been a lovely scene if not so over-done in post-production.</td>', '"Just because you can, doesn''t mean you should!"  The colors seem to result from Topaz "Venice" or something similar.  I have a feeling this would have been a lovely scene if not so over-done in post-production.', '2010-11-24 11:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
