(6234355, 920552, 86447, '<td valign="top">I really, really, really like this image!   I''m giving it a 7 because I think it''s more about the fabulously-captured birds than the clouds, but it would be a 9 in a Free Study.   Well done!   (voted earlier, back to comment)</td>', 'I really, really, really like this image!   I''m giving it a 7 because I think it''s more about the fabulously-captured birds than the clouds, but it would be a 9 in a Free Study.   Well done!   (voted earlier, back to comment)', '2010-11-26 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
