(6234425, 921643, 24073, '<td valign="top">I do really enjoy this photo, it seems to be a big hole that you could almost travel time through.  It doesn''t come through as a crisp, clean, snappy shot.  Hella potential, the colors are awesome, the clouds are nice, and it is quite enchanting.  Maybe the blown out part is what throws it off for me.</td>', 'I do really enjoy this photo, it seems to be a big hole that you could almost travel time through.  It doesn''t come through as a crisp, clean, snappy shot.  Hella potential, the colors are awesome, the clouds are nice, and it is quite enchanting.  Maybe the blown out part is what throws it off for me.', '2010-11-26 17:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234428, 920571, 24073, '<td valign="top">Kinda boring, and the clouds aren''t the main focus of the photo.  However its execution seems pro, and the photo overall is above par.</td>', 'Kinda boring, and the clouds aren''t the main focus of the photo.  However its execution seems pro, and the photo overall is above par.', '2010-11-26 17:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234433, 921508, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very interesting cloud cover, and the rest of the photo seems solid.  A wind blown dress on the subject would of took this over the top for me.  The fact that the human subject blends into the background at the head subtracts a little from the photo, but it is Mother Nature at her finest, I''ll give ya that.</td>', 'Very interesting cloud cover, and the rest of the photo seems solid.  A wind blown dress on the subject would of took this over the top for me.  The fact that the human subject blends into the background at the head subtracts a little from the photo, but it is Mother Nature at her finest, I''ll give ya that.', '2010-11-26 17:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234436, 921639, 24073, '<td valign="top">Needs just a little more to make it really stand out, and be interesting.</td>', 'Needs just a little more to make it really stand out, and be interesting.', '2010-11-26 17:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234437, 921579, 24073, '<td valign="top">The clouds are the challenge, and that you got.  Beautiful clouds, the photo overall needs just a bit more to be really, really interesting.</td>', 'The clouds are the challenge, and that you got.  Beautiful clouds, the photo overall needs just a bit more to be really, really interesting.', '2010-11-26 17:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234438, 921605, 24073, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Clouds were the challenge, and you got it.  The plane crisp, and clean, and perfectly located.  The minimilisim nature of this photo is just wonderful.  I''m initially given this a 10, but may be back to re-investigate. GJ.</td>', 'Love it.  Clouds were the challenge, and you got it.  The plane crisp, and clean, and perfectly located.  The minimilisim nature of this photo is just wonderful.  I''m initially given this a 10, but may be back to re-investigate. GJ.', '2010-11-26 17:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234440, 921606, 24073, '<td valign="top">So close!  The idea-great, the clouds-great, the bird-awesome.  Something is off, I''m not good enough to know what it is.  Still given a much better score than just par.</td>', 'So close!  The idea-great, the clouds-great, the bird-awesome.  Something is off, I''m not good enough to know what it is.  Still given a much better score than just par.', '2010-11-26 17:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
