(6239641, 920926, 113591, '<td valign="top">I see a dark message in here. She''s controlling the weather. We''re doomed. :)</td>', 'I see a dark message in here. She''s controlling the weather. We''re doomed. :)', '2010-12-01 01:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
