(6239684, 921524, 21714, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys. <br/> <br/>You are welcome, Paul and thanks Don for the yellow. <br/> <br/>Les, I gotta check how I beat you. I was trying to be serious there with the details, you see.</td>', 'Thanks guys.  You are welcome, Paul and thanks Don for the yellow.  Les, I gotta check how I beat you. I was trying to be serious there with the details, you see.', '2010-12-01 01:48:10.000000', NULL, 0),
