(6239730, 921567, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your win! It is a fantastic image. And it''s a great story that you have shared. I''m glad your effort paid off, and that you listened to your wife. (You always should, you know.)</td>', 'Congratulations on your win! It is a fantastic image. And it''s a great story that you have shared. I''m glad your effort paid off, and that you listened to your wife. (You always should, you know.)', '2010-12-01 03:23:20.000000', NULL, 0),
