(6239771, 920997, 113156, '<td valign="top">now that you mention it i can see a face. do not understand how this scored so low, peoples minds are so different, i guess that''s a good thing.</td>', 'now that you mention it i can see a face. do not understand how this scored so low, peoples minds are so different, i guess that''s a good thing.', '2010-12-01 04:47:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6239799, 921062, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Be. Beautiful image, love the movement in the sky..</td>', 'Congratulations, Be. Beautiful image, love the movement in the sky..', '2010-12-01 05:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6239918, 921567, 100831, '<td valign="top">Your work and your family''s dedication paid off! What wonderful light and color. Terrific. Congratulations on the win!</td>', 'Your work and your family''s dedication paid off! What wonderful light and color. Terrific. Congratulations on the win!', '2010-12-01 07:31:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6239919, 921239, 100831, '<td valign="top">Excellent textures and I love the whole idea! Super BW. CONGRATS!</td>', 'Excellent textures and I love the whole idea! Super BW. CONGRATS!', '2010-12-01 07:34:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6239926, 921489, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wonderful reflections and great compositional elements! Nice.</td>', 'Wonderful reflections and great compositional elements! Nice.', '2010-12-01 07:45:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6239960, 921062, 86447, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Ben!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations, Ben! ', '2010-12-01 08:16:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6239968, 920682, 33736, '<td valign="top">This was one of my highest scoring images (8).  It''s hard to believe that it didn''t rank higher. You did a beautiful job capturing the colors (and that title was perfect!)</td>', 'This was one of my highest scoring images (8).  It''s hard to believe that it didn''t rank higher. You did a beautiful job capturing the colors (and that title was perfect!)', '2010-12-01 08:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6239976, 921665, 33736, '<td valign="top">Cripes - voters confuse me! Clouds are the star of the show, not blown-out, surrounded by fascinating silhouettes (loved the jagged shapes against the softly rounded clouds, btw!) and topped off with that bird for a teeny accent piece.  For heaven''s sake, what more did they want???!!!!  lollll This was one of my highest vote-getters!  an 8</td>', 'Cripes - voters confuse me! Clouds are the star of the show, not blown-out, surrounded by fascinating silhouettes (loved the jagged shapes against the softly rounded clouds, btw!) and topped off with that bird for a teeny accent piece.  For heaven''s sake, what more did they want???!!!!  lollll This was one of my highest vote-getters!  an 8', '2010-12-01 08:37:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6239986, 921119, 33736, '<td valign="top">Donald nailed my opinion well.  Regardless, this was one of my 7''s.  Beautiful shot.  Btw, your story backs up why I never ever go anywhere without my camera - in the "You never know....!!" philosophy.</td>', 'Donald nailed my opinion well.  Regardless, this was one of my 7''s.  Beautiful shot.  Btw, your story backs up why I never ever go anywhere without my camera - in the "You never know....!!" philosophy.', '2010-12-01 08:42:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240001, 921475, 33736, '<td valign="top">I left a detailed comment during the Challenge because it''s a wonderful shot.  To me, it''s worth working on a little more.  The curvatures of the water and sand areas are terrific.  You may not have ranked highly in the Challenge itself, but with some tweaking, it would be be print-worthy, imo. <br/> <br/>I totally emphasize with your sense of discouragement - judging results sure confuse the heck out of me most weeks. But, keep working on it - the Challenge still presents a good learning experience.  Regardless of where you place still offers you the opportunity to compare your picture against others - what appeals and why.  Learn from that.</td>', 'I left a detailed comment during the Challenge because it''s a wonderful shot.  To me, it''s worth working on a little more.  The curvatures of the water and sand areas are terrific.  You may not have ranked highly in the Challenge itself, but with some tweaking, it would be be print-worthy, imo.  I totally emphasize with your sense of discouragement - judging results sure confuse the heck out of me most weeks. But, keep working on it - the Challenge still presents a good learning experience.  Regardless of where you place still offers you the opportunity to compare your picture against others - what appeals and why.  Learn from that.', '2010-12-01 08:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240007, 921072, 33736, '<td valign="top">This was one of my higher scorers (that tree is wonderful, and the clouds reigned!)  But, darn it - I wish you had answered the location question!   It looks like a Lake Huron or Ontario beach shot (especially, with the freighter on the horizon.)  Not knowing places and id''d buildings, etc drives me nuts. lolll</td>', 'This was one of my higher scorers (that tree is wonderful, and the clouds reigned!)  But, darn it - I wish you had answered the location question!   It looks like a Lake Huron or Ontario beach shot (especially, with the freighter on the horizon.)  Not knowing places and id''d buildings, etc drives me nuts. lolll', '2010-12-01 09:00:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240009, 921575, 101581, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kathy:</b></div><hr/><i> "Clouds" is the Challenge, not "Post".  The blurry skies (and the haloing around the post, from "selection tool"?) has me scoring this low. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I bet myself £20 that you would turn out to be a rude American, I was right !<br/>Why do you feel the need to sound-off in such a obnoxious way?<br/>You must be really good, right?</td>', 'Originally posted by Kathy: "Clouds" is the Challenge, not "Post".  The blurry skies (and the haloing around the post, from "selection tool"?) has me scoring this low.   I bet myself £20 that you would turn out to be a rude American, I was right !Why do you feel the need to sound-off in such a obnoxious way?You must be really good, right?', '2010-12-01 09:02:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240010, 921260, 33736, '<td valign="top">One of my higher scorers, but yep - that unleveled horizon didn''t help the image any - nor the little-too-bright clouds in the upper right area.  But, on the whole - this should have ranked a lot higher than it did.</td>', 'One of my higher scorers, but yep - that unleveled horizon didn''t help the image any - nor the little-too-bright clouds in the upper right area.  But, on the whole - this should have ranked a lot higher than it did.', '2010-12-01 09:05:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240014, 921612, 33736, '<td valign="top">Welcome.  Your entry drew a 7 from me (one of my higher ones.) You did a great job not blowing out the sun, itself.</td>', 'Welcome.  Your entry drew a 7 from me (one of my higher ones.) You did a great job not blowing out the sun, itself.', '2010-12-01 09:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240020, 921306, 33736, '<td valign="top">Got a 7 from me! I would have liked a little more interest along the bottom - or a little less (that snippet of a tree should have ''company'' or be eliminated altogether. Regardless, it''s a terrific picture.</td>', 'Got a 7 from me! I would have liked a little more interest along the bottom - or a little less (that snippet of a tree should have ''company'' or be eliminated altogether. Regardless, it''s a terrific picture.', '2010-12-01 09:18:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240023, 921602, 33736, '<td valign="top">My guess is that you ''Topazed'' this one, but I liked it a lot because of that.  One of my higher scores.</td>', 'My guess is that you ''Topazed'' this one, but I liked it a lot because of that.  One of my higher scores.', '2010-12-01 09:21:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240032, 921632, 33736, '<td valign="top">Yeah, the foreground did you in on this one (watch those darned fence posts and grasses when shooting! - always a pain for me, too.)  Regardless, it was one of my high scorers - the clouds beat out many of those that ranked higher, imo.</td>', 'Yeah, the foreground did you in on this one (watch those darned fence posts and grasses when shooting! - always a pain for me, too.)  Regardless, it was one of my high scorers - the clouds beat out many of those that ranked higher, imo.', '2010-12-01 09:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240101, 921619, 33736, '<td valign="top">This was one of my higher scores (7) - not sure why it didn''t do better (those beautiful clouds were perfectly exposed, imo.)  It did occur to me that there was an awful lot of everything in the image, but I couldn''t decide what could be cut out as unnecessary (sort of like a Mom with too many children - which ones could be removed???!!!)</td>', 'This was one of my higher scores (7) - not sure why it didn''t do better (those beautiful clouds were perfectly exposed, imo.)  It did occur to me that there was an awful lot of everything in the image, but I couldn''t decide what could be cut out as unnecessary (sort of like a Mom with too many children - which ones could be removed???!!!)', '2010-12-01 10:06:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240106, 921567, 15711, '<td valign="top">Well done.  The voters did right by you.</td>', 'Well done.  The voters did right by you.', '2010-12-01 10:09:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240107, 921595, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this deserved first place.  I rarely give 10''s and this was one of them.</td>', 'Sorry, but this deserved first place.  I rarely give 10''s and this was one of them.', '2010-12-01 10:09:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6240108, 921198, 15711, '<td valign="top">Just lovely!!! Congrats.</td>', 'Just lovely!!! Congrats.', '2010-12-01 10:09:59.000000', NULL, 0),
